1
00:00:00,712 --> 00:00:04,672
(Sheldon:)It is only by opening the box
that you'll find out which it is.

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:08,390
(Penny:)Okay, so you're saying
I should go out with Leonard?

3
00:00:08,553 --> 00:00:10,553
(Leonard:)No, no, no.

4
00:00:12,057 --> 00:00:15,147
(Sheldon:)Let me start again.
In 1935, Erwin Schrödinger...

5
00:00:17,688 --> 00:00:19,358
(Leonard(pointing):)Two seats right there.

6
00:00:21,692 --> 00:00:23,692
[SPEAKING IN MANDARIN]

7
00:00:31,159 --> 00:00:33,079
(Leonard:)Sheldon, I think I've made a mistake.

8
00:00:33,245 --> 00:00:35,625
(Sheldon:)I can see that.
Unless you're running a marathon...

9
00:00:35,789 --> 00:00:39,919
(Sheldon:)...choosing both stuffing and mashed
potatoes is a starch-filled redundancy.

10
00:00:40,585 --> 00:00:41,835
(Leonard:)No, it's about Penny.

11
00:00:42,004 --> 00:00:44,794
(Sheldon:)A mistake involving Penny.

12
00:00:44,965 --> 00:00:47,005
(Sheldon:)Okay, you'll have to narrow it down.

13
00:00:48,218 --> 00:00:50,218
(Leonard:)I don't think
I can go out with her tonight.

14
00:00:50,387 --> 00:00:51,717
(Sheldon:)Then don't.

15
00:00:52,514 --> 00:00:54,224
Other people would say, "Why not?"

16
00:00:54,391 --> 00:00:56,601
(Sheldon:)Other people might be interested.

17
00:00:58,103 --> 00:01:02,023
- I'm gonna talk anyway.
- I assumed you would.

